        <p begin="00:00:02.480" end="00:00:09.240" tts:direction="ltr">Hey, all. Welcome to this week's topic on
<br />Solver.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:09.240" end="00:00:14.080" tts:direction="ltr">In previous weeks, when we did our
<br />modeling unit,</p>
